<BaseLayout title="CV"><PageIntro eyebrow="A little context" title="The long version." description="A snapshot of the work, study, and questions that shaped my practice."/><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-14 border-t border-[var(--line)] px-6 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr]"><aside><p class="mono text-xs uppercase text-[var(--coral)]">Contact</p><a class="mt-4 block font-bold" href="mailto:hello@mfeofanova.dev">hello@mfeofanova.dev</a><a class="mt-6 inline-block border border-[var(--ink)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold" href="/resume.pdf" download>Download résumé ↓</a></aside><div><h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-extrabold">Experience</h2><div class="border-t border-[var(--line)]"><div class="border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5"><b>Independent designer & developer</b><p class="m-0 text-[var(--muted)]">Selected collaborations, 2022—now</p></div><div class="border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5"><b>Product designer, Northstar</b><p class="m-0 text-[var(--muted)]">Digital products for public good, 2020—22</p></div></div><h2 class="mb-6 mt-14 text-2xl font-extrabold">Education & skills</h2><p><b>MA Interaction Design</b><br/>Aalto University, 2020</p><p class="text-[var(--muted)]">TypeScript, Astro, React, Figma, CSS, writing</p></div></div></BaseLayout>
